Z||000015||rogergarrison||09-23-2001||06:07 PM||||Never been a fan of wings. Theyre ok on indy cars and sprint cars, but my opinion is they clutter up (any) cars lines. They dont serve any purpose anyway except a place to tie snowboard ropes. Ive seen nice looking cars with them, but theyd look just as good without them. ||||reg||1
